  "notes": "A relatively strong word implying active, deliberate prevention. Common in news and political contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {未然|みぜん}に{阻止|そし}する: to nip in the bud, to prevent before it happens\n- {計画|けいかく}を{阻止|そし}する: to block a plan\n- {侵入|しんにゅう}を{阻止|そし}する: to prevent intrusion\n- {拡大|かくだい}を{阻止|そし}する: to prevent spread/expansion\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {防|ふせ}ぐ: to prevent, to protect against — general everyday word\n- {阻止|そし}する: to block, to thwart — stronger, implies actively stopping someone's action or plan\n- {妨|さまた}げる: to hinder, to obstruct — implies getting in the way and slowing progress",
